Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 21:13:18 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] HTDESIGNER-147: laptop package 109's designer part merged
 into the machine tree -- ES02's 0.146-0.147 (0.147.0)

GitHub main bd20f84 (GitLab c4ddcada), mixed; its C++ / web part = the integration session's cpp 0076 (3f4835f).
Three-way on the package's base_7a3c28a7 (= package 108), against the tree as it is now, CRLF to LF first:
extension.js, package.json, WPF_DIFF_LOG.md, media/search.css, media/search.js, test/smoke_extension.js changed
only by ES02 (taken); CHANGELOG.md, HANDOVER.md on both sides (git merge-file, no conflict: ES02's text plus the
machine's notes for packages 106-109). lib/aliasedit.js (the machine's tools 0136 Alias patch) not in the package:
the machine's copy stays.
ES02's 0.146: a search box right above the Solution Explorer (typing filters files, pages and components; Enter /
Down into the list, Esc clears; Ctrl+F / Ctrl+; in the explorer go to it); 0.147: that box is one line only (its
hint in the tooltip, the counts in the explorer's title), and each side view's title bar gets a solid colour and a
border like Visual Studio's tool windows (only the current colour theme, the user's own colours kept, set once;
command "side view frames: on / off").
Tests: lib 176/176, probe 7/7 + tab tree 7/7, extension 213/213, panels all pass; e2e_build.ps1 not run.

